{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01RY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$Y$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$x \\in X$", "MATH_0005": "$y \\in Y$", "MATH_0006": "$X \\times_S Y$", "MATH_0007": "$x$", "MATH_0008": "$y$", "MATH_0009": "$x$", "MATH_0010": "$y$", "MATH_0011": "$S$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-when-point-maps-to-pair}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:78737e39364fc3df4ffefd95f1838e4909b61faf9497a01cca017dfc621c4eec", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f1833e6159ca1fe108df343d9d1828d1c5dfcb23b119ef2d479ef7540637cc33", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> be schemes over a base scheme <MATH_0003>. Given points <MATH_0004> and\n<MATH_0005>, there is a point of <MATH_0006> mapping to <MATH_0007> and <MATH_0008> under the\nprojections if and only if <MATH_0009> and <MATH_0010> lie above the same point of <MATH_0011>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:51d98a048c31aba8b0e526553001e65687fbf124b25afa63bceb76209074dff6", "unit_id": "tag:0495:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01RY", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-points-fibre-product}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2f3b9772d41af4b39bbab33e48c536888e9d807b097615b54276379448dd380d", "source_text": "The condition is obviously necessary, and the converse follows from the proof\nof Schemes, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b6a12f1d55e6ac262e35c023b442ea1326920be2abe1bc822d160b64eaec865c", "unit_id": "tag:0495:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01RY", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-surjective}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c5aac0fb2636ca09a0f4d8cfe16e0fea0b47cdafb29def5d82f3cb6b8093cfad", "source_text": "The base change of a surjective morphism is surjective.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0d5614dbadbf8741512daa6ee61694cffd32e3cab3ae71b919ab1c129a04b3fe", "unit_id": "tag:01S1:statement"}
